  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The events of the Continuous Access Evaluation Profile as typed payloads with their registered event type identifiers, so a transmitter emits and a receiver handles a session revocation or a credential change without hand-writing claim names. Registered over the Security Events core in one call; the same models serve a Shared Signals transmitter and receiver. Full details: https://github.com/Abblix/Oidc.Server/releases/tag/v2.4",
